         recommended test: A reader can see the rule only permits reuse when all four conditions are satisfied.
           inputs:  Use four targeted decision cases against `acceptance.carry.decide`: one where only `still_applies` is false while the other three checks pass, one where only `stage_logic_matches` is false while the others pass, one where `prior_key != current_key` while the others pass, and one where all four checks pass. These inputs must isolate each condition so a defect that omits one check or adds an extra check changes the outcome.
